          <tbody>
            <tr><td>How to Make Sourdough Bread at Home</td><td>post?id=4172</td><td>sourdough-bread-at-home</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Our Refund Policy</td><td>Our_Refund_Policy</td><td>refund-policy</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Café Opening Hours</td><td>caf%C3%A9-opening-hours</td><td>cafe-opening-hours</td></tr>
            <tr><td>10 Best Laptops for Students</td><td>10-best-laptops-for-students-2024-cheap-best</td><td>best-student-laptops</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2>Slug Checklist</h2>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li><strong>Short and descriptive:</strong> a reader should guess what the page is about from the URL alone.</li>
        <li><strong>Lowercase with hyphens:</strong> consistent, easy to type and recommended by Google.</li>
        <li><strong>No dates or numbers that will change:</strong> unless they are part of what the page is.</li>
        <li><strong>Stable:</strong> once published, keep the slug. If you must change it, redirect the old URL permanently.</li>
        <li><strong>Unique:</strong> two pages in the same folder cannot share a slug; bulk mode numbers repeats for you.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>ToolsBuilt follows these rules for its own pages, such as /tools/remove-duplicate-lines/ and /tools/text-diff-checker/. Everything on this page runs in your browser and nothing you type is stored.</p>
    </section>
